This repository holds work under two licences.

GPL-2.0 (the full text is in kernel/COPYING):
  kernel/patches/                         patches to Unisoc's audio drivers
  kernel/modules/5.4.254-gb50db5b6224c/   the 23 drivers built from those sources with those patches

  Both derive from Unisoc's GPL-2.0 audio driver sources for the 5.4 kernel, as published in realme's kernel
  source release (https://github.com/realme-kernel-opensource/realme_C51_C53_Narzo-N53-AndroidT-kernel-source,
  kernel_modules/kernel5.4/audio_driver, revision 4381465ccaf87fcf3215b9cd42f4a685df40e5e0), built against the
  vendor 5.4 kernel of mu300-linux. The complete build, with the sources fetched at that revision and these
  patches applied, is kernel/build-audio.sh in https://github.com/dikeckaan/mu300-linux.

MIT (below): everything else - install.sh, uninstall.sh, device/, src/, tools/, tests/.

Not covered by either, and not in this repository: the AGDSP firmware and the vendor parameter files, which
belong to Unisoc / ZTE and which every user supplies from their own device.

